<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en"><head><title>Change Alerts subscription · bitcoin++</title>{{ block "header" . }}{{ end }}
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/login-layout.css?v=4"></head>
<body class="btcpp-login-page alerts-upgrade-page">{{ block "mainnav" . }}{{ end }}
<main class="auth-shell auth-shell--simple"><section class="auth-card">
<header class="auth-card__head"><span class="auth-kicker">bitcoin++ Alerts</span><h1>{{ if .Retained }}Your current plan{{ else }}Reduce your subscription{{ end }}</h1></header>
<p role="status">{{ .Message }}</p>
<dl class="alerts-upgrade-summary"><div><dt>Paid project subscriptions</dt><dd>{{ if .Retained }}{{ .Previous }}{{ else }}{{ .Previous }} → {{ .Desired }}{{ end }}<small>Plus your three free projects</small></dd></div>
{{ if not .Retained }}<div><dt>Effective date</dt><dd>{{ .Period }}</dd></div>{{ end }}
<div><dt>{{ if .Retained }}Continuing annual total{{ else }}New annual total{{ end }}</dt><dd>{{ .Annual }}<small>Including applicable tax</small></dd></div></dl>
{{ if .CanConfirm }}<p>Confirming schedules this lower quantity for your next renewal. Your current paid period stays unchanged.</p>
<form method="post" class="alerts-upgrade-action"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="{{ .CSRF }}"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="confirm"><button type="submit" class="auth-primary">Confirm decrease · {{ .Annual }}/year</button></form>{{ end }}
{{ if .CanWithdraw }}<p>Changed your mind? Withdraw this decrease to keep your current project allowance and annual price.</p>
<form method="post" class="alerts-upgrade-action"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="{{ .CSRF }}"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="withdraw"><button type="submit" class="auth-primary">Keep my current plan</button></form>{{ end }}
<p class="alerts-upgrade-links"><a href="/services/alerts/manage">Manage billing</a> · <a href="https://alerts.btcpp.dev/alerts">My alerts</a></p>
</section></main></body></html>
